      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magnolia%2C_Kentucky"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Magnolia originated as a stop on the Louisville and Nashville Turnpike.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://kyatlas.com/ky-magnolia.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town was originally called Centerpoint because it sat at the midway point between sections of the stagecoach line.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
